ype": "post_instructions"}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le12ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "", "text": "<span class=strong>Denise</span>: Now, that we have decided on promotion strategies. Let's move onto the release date.<br>\n<span class=strong>Kristi</span>: There are many advantages to picking a date. However, in order for us to settle on one, we need to ensure that everything else is in place. <br>\n<span class=strong>Denise</span>: I think most of it has been worked out, the only outstanding item is the book launch party. <br>\n<span class=strong>Marisa</span>: How about Family Day? Would we able to release the book then? <br>\n<span class=strong>Kristi</span>: Let's take a look. (pulls out a calendar) Okay, so it falls on a Monday this year. On the one hand, since it's a statutory holiday, families with young children are more likely to visit bookstores. On the other hand, there may be more children's books being released. With that in mind, this release date may not give us the sales we're hoping for. <br>\n<span class=strong>Marisa</span>: I'm not expecting to become a New York Times Bestseller. Nonetheless, I do see your point. How about a soft launch?<br>\n<span class=strong>Denise</span>:  That's a good idea. A soft launch does come with its own set of advantages. <br>\n<span class=strong>Kristi</span>: As a new author, it's much more important to build up your fan base than spend time, energy, or money on promotion. In contrast, a hard launch will definitely get your name out there, in addition to getting publicity. Isn't that what we're hoping to do?<br>\n<span class=strong>Marisa</span>: That's what I thought I wanted, but now \u2026 I'm not so sure. <br>\n<span class=strong>Denise</span>: Okay. Why don't we look at the big picture? One of the benefits of a soft launch is that there will be more time to do things and it's less stressful. One of the drawbacks is not having enough time to do all the public appearances we would want to do. <br>\n<span class=strong>Kristi</span>: Adding to that, if we're looking to see quick results, choosing a hard launch over a soft launch is probably the best method. One of the disadvantages with a soft launch, is that it will take longer for you to see any significant results. <br>\n<span class=strong>Denise</span>: Promoting the book with blog posts and through word of mouth is a soft launch. We'll see results, but they will take time, whereas scheduling a book tour, sending out news releases, creating promotional videos and building an online following is a hard launch that will produce faster results.<br>\n<span class=strong>Marisa</span>: I've made up my mind, let's go with a hard launch!", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le12ob05re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le12ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le12ob05re2img01.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "1", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Now that we've decided on a promotional strategy, let's move on to a release date.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: There are many advantages to picking a date. However, in order for us to settle on one, everything else must be in place. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: I think we've worked everything else out,  just one outstanding item, which is the book launch party. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: How about Thanksgiving? Could we release it then? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Let's take a look. Okay, so it falls on a Thursday. On the one hand, since it's a statutory holiday, families with young children are more likely to visit bookstores. On the other hand, there may be more children's books being released. With that in mind, this date may not give us the sales we're hoping for. <br>", "id": 0, "image": ""}, {"time": "50000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: I'm not expecting to get onto the <span class=\"italic\">New York Times</span> Bestseller list. Nonetheless, I do see your point. How about a soft launch?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>:  That's a good idea. A soft launch does come with its own set of advantages. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: As a new author, it's much more important to build up your fan base than spend time, energy, or money on large-scale promotion. In contrast, a hard launch would definitely get your name out there, in addition to getting publicity. Isn't that what we're hoping to do?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: I thought so, but ... I'm not really sure.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Okay. Why don't we look at the big picture? Some benefits of a soft launch would be that you'd have a lot more time to do things and it's a lot less stressful. One of the drawbacks would be that we wouldn't have enough time to make all those public appearances that we want to do.", "id": 1, "image": ""}, {"time": "106300", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Adding to that, if we're looking to see quick results, choosing a hard launch over a soft launch is probably the best method. One of the disadvantages with a soft launch, is that it will take longer for you to see any significant results. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Promoting your book via blog posts and through word of mouth is a soft launch. The results will take time, whereas scheduling a book tour, sending out news releases, creating promotional videos and building an online following ... that's a hard launch and that will produce faster results.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: I think I've made my decision ... let's have a hard launch!", "id": 2, "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn11le12ob05re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": [], "title": ""}]}]}